#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0395 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a parameter, there is more than one value of ATOXGRL for a given value of ATOXGRLN, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col ATOXGRL type=Char
col ATOXGRLN type=Char
---
Label A | A
Label B | B
Label A | A
---
